Constraints for this project live in `AGENT.md` (the "Hard stops" and "Code discipline" sections at the top).
Read `AGENT.md` now if you have not already — those rules apply unconditionally.

After every task, run the post-task reflection:

- **Q1:** Constraint to always enforce? → propose `plugins/project-template/rules/cursor/[topic].mdc`, then regenerate Cursor assets
- **Q2:** Repeatable workflow? → propose `plugins/project-template/skills/[domain]-[action]/`, then regenerate harness assets
- **Q3:** System fact changed or non-obvious decision made? → update canonical file per `docs/SSOT-map.md`, or append to `docs/architecture/decisions.md`

Write raw observations to `LEARNINGS.md` first. Then distill. Propose all additions — do not add silently.

If the task modified `docs/`, `plugins/`, `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/context/`, `.cursor/skills/`, or `AGENT.md`:
→ run `.cursor/rules/self-check.mdc` before closing
